pper to attempt to crack default or weak passwords on smart home devices.\n    Unpatched Firmware: Analyze firmware updates for vulnerabilities using tools like binwalk and Ghidra. Develop scripts to exploit these vulnerabilities if found.\n    Insecure Protocols: Intercept and analyze network traffic using Wireshark to identify vulnerabilities in communication protocols. Use tools like Scapy to craft and send malicious packets.\n    Command Injection: Identify devices vulnerable to command injection and craft malicious commands to gain unauthorized access or control."}
